==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Cooldown Equality}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*30 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 6.67~8 seconds<sup>200f~240f</sup>.
*3 [[Othom]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Galactic Overseer Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*20 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Loris]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*20 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Like the Only One Rarity rule's [[Round 4 (Only One Rarity)|Round 4]] before it, this stage can easily be [[cheese]]d by spamming [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|Rushers]] at the start plus a [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breaker]] to take care of the first UltraBaaBaa.

